{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S09：把怀念旧日生活与归属的复杂心情改写成舍不得过去或只想在难受时有人陪，容易把 Center 缩窄为对陪伴的需要，没有充分呈现这种需要可能动摇他维持尊严的坚持。\",\n    \"S08：回忆带来的暖意与是否回头之间的关系较模糊，没有像 Y 那样明确呈现怀念升起却仍不愿因此放弃离开的选择。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S04：额外突出自己是否后悔离开的自我追问，略微把注意力引向离开决定本身是否正确，而非尊严坚持与归属怀念的拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 更完整地把怀念被当作自己人的生活、对孤独的恐惧，以及不愿重新忍受委屈以维护尊严缠在一起。尤其 S08、S09、S12 不仅呈现两股力量同时存在，还呈现怀念如何诱发回头的可能、又如何被尊严上的坚持牵制，因此更贴近 Center。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eea47ec5-e14d-48da-bcd0-e9047fd1e4cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093250025404Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:33:11.600905+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1e2bd321e7324f40554bd64da84059786f13eb6d84a31834b3bee9947007efd2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt